# The `goldens` row above covers the micro differential generically, through a
# golden that drifts. This one covers the direction the corpus could not see
# until 2026-09-14: the two engines PARSING a decimal differently. Rendering
# has had rows since kanso#1256; reading one back had none, and native sat one
# ULP off the oracle on every number longer than nineteen significant digits.
# A drifted golden and a diverged engine are different defects and a mutation
# that moves a `.out` file cannot produce the second.
truncated_significand = row
  "a truncated significand the fast path calls certain"
  true
  "cargo test --release --test golden micro_corpus_agrees_across_engines"
  "specs (unit, golden, differential)"
  (breaking "a_truncated_significand_taken_as_certain")
  release

